msgstr "Mer om beholdning"

#: admin/views/settings.php:123
msgid ""
"Fixes older than this stay in your history for reference, but the Revert "
"button is removed. They are not deleted from the database unless you prune "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Fikser eldre enn dette blir værende i historikken din som referanse, men "
"Tilbakestill-knappen fjernes. De slettes ikke fra databasen med mindre du "
